:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{y}^{2}+8y+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4({y}^{2}+2y)+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4[(y+1)^{2}-1]+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+1)^{2}-4+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+1)^{2}+9{z}^{2}-5x+5 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by rearranging, we get the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(y+1)^{2}+9{z}^{2}-5x+5 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+1)^{2}+9{z}^{2} & =5(x-1) \\\\ \\frac{4(y+1)^{2}}{5}+\\frac{9{z}^{2}}{5} & =x-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of an elliptic paraboloid centered at $(1,-1,0).$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399371 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399372 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399373 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399374 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399375 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399373 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399370 1080 #uuid "c51d387c-bf0a-5c35-97a8-9dc15337e4ac" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399371 1081 "A hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $(-1,0,1)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399371 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399371 1084 #uuid "adf28e93-9856-5b88-a118-c7fdc1ed380b" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399372 1081 "An elliptic paraboloid centered at $(-1,1,0)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399372 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399372 1084 #uuid "d6d90baa-2f68-5b86-bc0d-0f5ed5239cce" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399373 1081 "An elliptic paraboloid centered at $(1,-1,0)$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399373 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045