.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399390 1072 #uuid "1fda33b2-0f78-5ef6-abce-da9e465c13f7" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399390 1074 "Let's start by writing the matrix $P-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nP-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}7-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ -5 & 7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(P-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(P-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}7-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ -5 & 7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (7-\\lambda )(7-\\lambda )-1\\cdot (-5) & =0 \\\\ 49-7\\lambda -7\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+5 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-14\\lambda +54 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the discriminant of the quadratic equation above, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =(-14)^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 54 \\\\  & =196-216 \\\\  & =-20 \\\\  & <0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the characteristic equation does not have real solutions and therefore $P$ does not have real eigenvalues." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399392 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399393 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399394 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399395 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399396 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399394 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399391 1080 #uuid "9c905a94-1e61-56fb-85f0-520ef6a3631a" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399392 1081 "$\\lambda =7$ (double root)" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399392 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399392 1084 #uuid "5ad3afc0-1147-5a90